Subject: [PATCH] feat(model): toolpath-model, the goldens work as one
 generated object model

A crate that reads the toolpath and pathbase repositories at a revision
(git ls-tree / git show) and emits one JSON model: harnesses, operations
(parse, project, resume, share), sets, snapshots, findings (loss, gain,
invented value, rename, known defect, declared-unpinned), the site's
claims with their computed status, PR pieces (pr/NN records, stack.json,
GitHub and Changeling links), qualifier concerns, and review feedback
from Clax threads. check() names every broken rule; the test runs it and
the JSON Schema over the committed model.
